# Read a knob
# Level 1 - Basics
#
# Read a potentiometer and see the value three ways, plus a live graph.
# You learn: 'analog', value, volts, percent and plot.
# You need: a potentiometer: middle leg to A0, outer legs to 5V and GND. Open the serial monitor or the plotter.

board uno

knob = analog A0

every 200 ms:
    print "raw {knob.value}   volts {knob.volts}   percent {knob.percent}"
    plot knob.percent              # a line in the plotter
